#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYWARG"
