#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT"
msgid "Pity. He was such a jolly fellow."
msgstr "Que pena. Ele era um rapaz tão alegre."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC"
msgid "Ah, excellent. No more leaving clothes on branches to get wrinkled."
msgstr "Ah, excelente. Chega de deixar as roupas em galhos e elas amassarem."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON"
msgid "You don't inspire a great deal of confidence, dear."
msgstr "Você não inspira muita confiança."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK"
msgid "Oh, I never considered myself much of an artist!"
msgstr "Oh, nunca me vi muito como artista."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT"
msgid "What a shame. It was a lovely addition."
msgstr "Que pena. Era uma adição adorável."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY"
msgid "A method of ceramic production. We somehow use it for sculpture."
msgstr "Um método para produção de cerâmica. De alguma forma o usamos para esculpir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE"
msgid "We were all in dire need of an emotional outlet, I believe."
msgstr "Tínhamos muita necessidade de uma fuga emocional, acredito eu."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED"
msgid "There's an almost animalistic ferocity in the chiselwork."
msgstr "Há uma ferocidade quase animalesca no trabalho de talhar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "An excellent repair job."
msgstr "Um conserto excelente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY"
msgid "Something is stirring within."
msgstr "Algo está ativo no interior."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "So this is what was lurking inside."
msgstr "Então é isso que estava espreitando lá dentro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD"
msgid "I can lift it. I'm more spry than I look."
msgstr "Posso levantar isso. Sou mais ágil que pareço."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED"
msgid "Very tasteful."
msgstr "De muito bom gosto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "The structure is whole once again."
msgstr "A estrutura está inteira novamente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY"
msgid "Something is stirring within."
msgstr "Algo está ativo no interior."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "They say every block of stone has a statue inside."
msgstr "Dizem que todos os blocos de pedra têm uma estátua em seu interior."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD"
msgid "You have to lift with your knees, dear."
msgstr "Você deve levantar usando os joelhos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED"
msgid "I feel a light dusting of magic. Odd."
msgstr "Sinto um leve espanar de magia. Estranho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "We may want to keep an eye on this."
msgstr "Talvez seja melhor ficar de olho nisso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY"
msgid "Something is stirring within."
msgstr "Algo está ativo no interior."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "What an awful state it's in!"
msgstr "Que estado horrível em que se encontra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE"
msgid "That's a thrown out back waiting to happen."
msgstr "A possibilidade de uma dor nas costas é tremenda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SEEDS"
msgid "A handful of unidentifiable seeds."
msgstr "Uma porção de sementes não identificáveis."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED"
msgid "A toasted embryonic plant treat!"
msgstr "Uma surpresa de planta embriônica assada!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD"
msgid "Ah! A scrying orb."
msgstr "Ah! Uma orbe de presciência."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT"
msgid "A simple implement for domestic tasks."
msgstr "Um implemento simples para tarefas domésticas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE"
msgid "A high grade adhesive, good for small mends."
msgstr "Um adesivo de alta gradação, bom para pequenos reparos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER"
msgid "Well, I suppose we did need an extra set of hands... Hm."
msgstr "Bem, suponho que precisávamos de um par de mãos extra... Hm."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART"
msgid "This... This is no child's magic."
msgstr "Essa... Essa não é magia para crianças..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL"
msgid "It's a shovel. Surely you've seen one before?"
msgstr "É uma pá. Com certeza você viu uma antes?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN"
msgid "Frog skin must remain damp, or they will suffocate. Not that this one minds."
msgstr "A pele dos sapos deve permanecer úmida, ou eles sufocam. Não que este aqui vá se importar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT"
msgid "It wasn't doing me much good anyhow."
msgstr "Não era muito boa mesmo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC"
msgid "I can barely sleep on a bed, nevermind the ground."
msgstr "Mal consigo dormir em uma cama, quanto mais no chão."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SILK"
msgid "Protein fiber extruded from an arachnid."
msgstr "Fibra proteica expelida de um aracnídeo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETON"
msgid "An incredibly well preserved human skeleton."
msgstr "Um esqueleto humano incrivelmente bem preservado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT"
msgid "It has a detrimental effect on the mortal mind."
msgstr "Tem um efeito prejudicial sobre a mente mortal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.DEFAULT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.DEFAULT"
msgid "%s's skeleton is a permanent reminder to be mindful around %s."
msgstr "O esqueleto de %s é um lembrete permanente de ter cuidado perto de %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.FEMALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.FEMALE"
msgid "%s's skeleton is a permanent reminder to be mindful around %s."
msgstr "O esqueleto de %s é um lembrete permanente de ter cuidado perto de %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.MALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.MALE"
msgid "%s's skeleton is a permanent reminder to be mindful around %s."
msgstr "O esqueleto de %s é um lembrete permanente de ter cuidado perto de %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.ROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.ROBOT"
msgid "%s's skeleton is a permanent reminder to be mindful around %s."
msgstr "O esqueleto de %s é um lembrete permanente de ter cuidado perto de %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKETCH"
msgid "Detailed diagrams of a stone sculpture."
msgstr "Diagramas perfeitos de uma escultura em pedra."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKULLCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SKULLCHEST"
msgid "A container resembling a cranium."
msgstr "Um recipiente que lembra um crânio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLEEPBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLEEPBOMB"
msgid "It's past your bedtime."
msgstr "Passou da sua hora de dormir."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURPER"
msgid "A classic example of symbiosis."
msgstr "Um exemplo clássico de simbiose."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT"
msgid "This must be useful for something."
msgstr "Isso deve ser útil para alguma coisa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT"
msgid "This must be useful for something."
msgstr "Isso deve ser útil para alguma coisa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE"
msgid "A mineral-devouring gastropod."
msgstr "Um gastrópodo devorador de minerais."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT"
msgid "It provides protection."
msgstr "Oferece proteção."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE"
msgid "A gastropod pod."
msgstr "Um casulo de gastrópode."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME"
msgid "Their mucus is explosive for some reason."
msgstr "Seu muco é explosivo por algum motivo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES"
msgid "Pieces of the broken."
msgstr "Pedaços quebrados."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "A rather diminutive specimen of the class Aves."
msgstr "Uma espécie bem diminutiva da classe das Aves."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "It requires sustenance."
msgstr "Precisa de sustento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "Without sustenance, it will surely perish."
msgstr "Sem sustento, certamente perecerá."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT"
msgid "It's a small, raw piece of meat."
msgstr "É um pequeno pedaço cru de carne."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "High sodium content."
msgstr "Alto teor de sódio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER"
msgid "What a ruffian!"
msgstr "Que belo rufião!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE"
msgid "A rare variant of gastropod."
msgstr "Uma variante rara de gastrópode."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPAT"
msgid "Ovis chalybs, and a right mean looking one at that."
msgstr "Ovis chalybs, e um que se parece bem mal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR"
msgid "Ancient weapons technology."
msgstr "Tecnologia de armamento antiga."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR"
msgid "I fear I'll not be much use with that."
msgstr "Receio que não serei de muita serventia com isso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE"
msgid "Such an ineffectual shape for a polearm."
msgstr "Tem um formato muito ineficaz para uma arma de haste."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR"
msgid "What a handsome hunting implement."
msgstr "Que implemento de caça maravilhoso!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD"
msgid "It's dead."
msgstr "Está morta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC"
msgid "A large, carnivorous arachnid species."
msgstr "Uma espécie de aracnídeo carnívoro grande."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING"
msgid "They appear to be nocturnal."
msgstr "Elas parecem ser notívagas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN"
msgid "Fascinating. These spiders have a communal hive."
msgstr "Fascinante! Essas aranhas têm uma colmeia comunal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK"
msgid "A highly portable spider egg sack."
msgstr "Um saco de ovos de aranha altamente portátil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND"
msgid "This gland secretes a mildly toxic venom."
msgstr "Essa glândula secreta um veneno levemente tóxico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT"
msgid "Psionic control to exert over spiders. Excluding the boy, of course."
msgstr "Controle psiônico para exercer sobre as aranhas. Exceto o garoto, é claro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE"
msgid "This is the source of the spider infestation."
msgstr "Essa é a fonte da infestação de aranhas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK"
msgid "This is the source of the spider infestation."
msgstr "Essa é a fonte da infestação de aranhas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN"
msgid "That must be the center of the hive-mind."
msgstr "Esse deve ser o centro da mente da colmeia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER"
msgid "Ah, this species of arachnid has adapted to life on the cave ceiling."
msgstr "Ah, essa espécie de aracnídeo se adaptou à vida nos tetos das cavernas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER"
msgid "An arachnid with a thick carapace."
msgstr "Um aracnídeo com uma carapaça grossa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER"
msgid "An arachnid that spits projectiles."
msgstr "Um aracnídeo que cospe projéteis."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD"
msgid "He gave his life for his queen."
msgstr "Ele deu sua via por sua rainha."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC"
msgid "It appears to be of the warrior caste."
msgstr "Parece ser da casta guerreira."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING"
msgid "A well deserved rest, no doubt."
msgstr "Um descanso bem merecido, sem dúvida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD"
msgid "It is heavy with bacteria."
msgstr "Está cheio de bactérias."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "A bright red carrier of genetic information."
msgstr "Um portador vermelho brilhante de informações genéticas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD"
msgid "I'm a carrier of a carrier of genetic information."
msgstr "Sou uma portadora de um portador de informações genéticas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "A lovely green carrier of genetic information."
msgstr "Um portador verde amável de informações genéticas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD"
msgid "I'm a carrier of a carrier of genetic information."
msgstr "Sou uma portadora de um portador de informações genéticas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "A soft blue carrier of genetic information."
msgstr "Um portador azul claro de informações genéticas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD"
msgid "I'm a carrier of a carrier of genetic information."
msgstr "Sou uma portadora de um portador de informações genéticas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT"
msgid "Some sort of self-contained aurora."
msgstr "Algum tipo de aura contida em si mesma."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT"
msgid "Perhaps a larger staff would summon a larger star."
msgstr "Um cajado maior talvez invocasse uma estrela maior."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO"
msgid "I've never seen a weather vane employed as a weapon."
msgstr "Nunca vi um cata-vento usado como uma arma."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE"
msgid "That was an underhanded trick!"
msgstr "Esse truque foi bem dissimulado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING"
msgid "Something devious is lurking in the shadows."
msgstr "Algo maligno espreita nas sombras."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE"
msgid "A strange rock formation."
msgstr "Uma formação rochosa estranha."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL"
msgid "Another stalagmite."
msgstr "Outra estalagmite."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALKER"
msgid "A mistake in need of correcting."
msgstr "Um erro que precisa ser corrigido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM"
msgid "We could have learned much from each other."
msgstr "Poderíamos ter trocado muitos ensinamentos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION"
msgid "The weaver's twisted creation."
msgstr "A criação distorcida do tecelão."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY"
msgid "Nope, just a statue."
msgstr "Não, é só uma estátua."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "Is it petrified?"
msgstr "Está petrificado?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP"
msgid "A simple statue."
msgstr "Uma estátua simples."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL"
msgid "He's actually quite a sweet boy when you peel away the ego."
msgstr "Na verdade, ele é um garoto muito simpático quando você retira seu ego."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1"
msgid "A Grecian-inspired sculpture of the muse Melpomene. Some liberties have been taken."
msgstr "Uma escultura inspirada no estilo grego da musa Melpomene. Algumas liberdades foram tomadas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2"
msgid "A Grecian-inspired sculpture of the muse Thalia. Some liberties have been taken."
msgstr "Uma escultura inspirada no estilo grego da musa Tália. Algumas liberdades foram tomadas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3"
msgid "The rain may inadvertently turn it into a bird bath."
msgstr "A chuva pode inadvertidamente a transformar em uma fonte para passarinhos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL"
msgid "It has a variety of household uses."
msgstr "Tem mil e uma utilidades domésticas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STINGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STINGER"
msgid "It tapers to a sharp point."
msgstr "Se afunila até se tornar uma ponta afiada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT"
msgid "This will offer some protection from the sun."
msgstr "Isso dará um pouco de proteção contra o sol."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT"
msgid "This aubergine has been cooked and packed with comestibles."
msgstr "Essa berinjela foi cozida e recheada com alimentos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED"
msgid "It will wither if not replanted."
msgstr "Vai secar se não for replantada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT"
msgid "Uniquely adapted to arid climates."
msgstr "Especialmente adaptada a climas áridos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED"
msgid "I wonder how my garden is doing without me."
msgstr "Como será que minha horta está sem mim?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUNKBOAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUNKBOAT"
msgid "A shipwreck, looks to be useless."
msgstr "Um barco naufragado, parece ser inútil."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST"
msgid "This vest screams \"stylish, but well-read.\"."
msgstr "Esse colete grita \"fashion, mas culta\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TAFFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TAFFY"
msgid "That's terrible for your teeth, dear."
msgstr "Isso estraga os dentes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD"
msgid "Magnus Avis, fully developed."
msgstr "Magnus Avis, completamente desenvolvido."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG"
msgid "It requires incubation."
msgstr "Necessita incubação."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED"
msgid "Full of cholesterol."
msgstr "Cheio de colesterol."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "You will catch your death of cold!"
msgstr "Você vai morrer de frio!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC"
msgid "Development appears to be progressing."
msgstr "O desenvolvimento parece estar progredindo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT"
msgid "Exposure to temperature extremes may result in death."
msgstr "A exposição a temperaturas extremas pode resultar na morte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG"
msgid "A watched pot never boils."
msgstr "Uma panela vigiada nunca ferve."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT"
msgid "We shall soon reap the fruits of our labors."
msgstr "Logo colheremos os frutos de nossos trabalhos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC"
msgid "What a tremendous Magnus Avis egg!"
msgstr "Que ovo de Magnus Avis magnífico!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED"
msgid "The nest is empty. Soon the cycle will begin anew."
msgstr "O ninho está vazio. Logo o ciclo começará novamente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "An adolescent avian."
msgstr "Uma ave adolescente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "Please keep your voice level to a minimum."
msgstr "Por favor, mantenha o volume da sua voz no mínimo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "A very naughty bird!"
msgstr "Um pássaro muito levado!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS"
msgid "I don't think it's powered yet."
msgstr "Não acho que esteja ativado ainda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID"
msgid "It looks to be ready."
msgstr "Parece estar pronto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE"
msgid "This machine can be used to travel between worlds."
msgstr "Essa máquina pode ser usada para viajar entre os mundos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC"
msgid "This runestone has unique geometric properties!"
msgstr "Essa runa tem propriedades geométricas únicas!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED"
msgid "The device needs to be activated."
msgstr "O dispositivo precisa ser ativado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL"
msgid "The device is in a partial state of completion."
msgstr "O dispositivo está em um estado parcial de completude."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX"
msgid "An electrical charge regulator."
msgstr "Um regulador de carga elétrica."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK"
msgid "It applies basic mechanical principles."
msgstr "Usa princípios mecânicos básicos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO"
msgid "Neither fully organic nor inorganic!"
msgstr "Nem totalmente orgânico nem inorgânico!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING"
msgid "A torus of alloys and wiring."
msgstr "Um toroide de ligas e fios."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF"
msgid "The gem appears to focus the nightmare fuel."
msgstr "A pedra preciosa parece concentrar o combustível de pesadelo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT"
msgid "It wasn't doing me much good anyhow."
msgstr "Não era muito boa mesmo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC"
msgid "Sleeping in there would give me a stiff neck."
msgstr "Dormir aí me deixaria com torcicolo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE"
msgid "A horror waiting in the mud."
msgstr "Um horror aguardando na lama."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE"
msgid "Never grab the pointy end."
msgstr "Nunca segure na extremidade pontiaguda."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS"
msgid "Hmmm, reproductive organs."
msgstr "Hmmm, órgãos reprodutores."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN"
msgid "I wonder how they breed?"
msgstr "Me pergunto como eles se reproduzem."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR"
msgid "There's more of it below than above!"
msgstr "Há mais disso embaixo que em cima!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM"
msgid "A tiny horror waiting in the mud."
msgstr "Um pequeno horror esperando na lama."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE"
msgid "It appears to be all connected somehow."
msgstr "Parece estar todo conectado, de alguma forma."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.THULECITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.THULECITE"
msgid "This seems to be an interesting, ectoplasmic residue-bearing variety of ziosite."
msgstr "Isso parece ser uma interessante variedade ectoplásmica, cheia de resíduo, de zoisite."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES"
msgid "These could be combined to make a bigger piece."
msgstr "Esses podiam ser combinados para fazer uma peça maior."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE"
msgid "We were its intended recipient."
msgstr "Éramos seu destinatário."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC"
msgid "It has formed a dangerous symbiotic relationship with fungal spores."
msgstr "Formou uma relação simbiótica perigosa com esporos fúngicos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE"
msgid "The symbiotic bond between toad and fungus has reached its apex."
msgstr "A ligação simbiótica entre o sapo e o fungo atingiu seu ápice."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY"
msgid "The soil has been disturbed here."
msgstr "Alguém mexeu no solo aqui."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC"
msgid "A new member of the Agaricus genus?"
msgstr "Um novo membro do genus Agaricus?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND"
msgid "The growth needs a catalyst to breach the surface."
msgstr "O crescimento precisa de um catalisador para vir à superfície."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT"
msgid "How bourgeois."
msgstr "Que afetação."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TORCH"
msgid "An improvised handheld light."
msgstr "Uma luz portátil improvisada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE"
msgid "The path is open."
msgstr "Um caminho está aberto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "It deconstructs the subject and reconstitutes them elsewhere."
msgstr "Ele desconstrói o objeto e o reconstrói em outro lugar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE"
msgid "The bezoar's magic has been activated."
msgstr "A magia do bezoar foi ativada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "A bezoar formed in the gut of a large beast."
msgstr "Um bezoar formado no estômago de uma grande fera."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX"
msgid "Mmmm, natural!"
msgstr "Mmmm, natural!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAILS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAILS"
msgid "All brawn and no brain, I'm afraid."
msgstr "Só músculo e nada de cérebro, receio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR"
msgid "This is quite advanced technology."
msgstr "Essa tecnologia é bem avançada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP"
msgid "A simple stick-and-basket trap."
msgstr "Uma simples armadilha de graveto e cesta."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH"
msgid "It's covered with a thin film of canine digestive fluid."
msgstr "Está coberto com uma fina camada de fluido digestivo canino."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL"
msgid "A crude attempt at tricking me."
msgstr "Uma tentativa tosca de me enganar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT"
msgid "The charred skeleton of a storage chest."
msgstr "O esqueleto carbonizado de um baú para armazenamento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "A storage chest."
msgstr "Um baú para armazenamento."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP"
msgid "Looks suspicious..."
msgstr "Parece suspeito..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP"
msgid "The flora grows thick here."
msgstr "A flora cresce firme por aqui."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREEGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREEGUARD"
msgid "Fascinating... it's become bipedal!"
msgstr "Fascinante... se transformou em bípede!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1"
msgid "What a lovely set of bottle washers! Too bad they're all melted."
msgstr "Que adorável conjunto de arruelas! Que pena que estão derretidas."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10"
msgid "I don't appreciate the insinuation, dear."
msgstr "Não gosto da insinuação."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11"
msgid "Ah, it's a scale replica of that mischievous robot."
msgstr "Ah, é uma réplica em escala daquele robô maldito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12"
msgid "A muscular hydrostat that's been sat near something hygroscopic."
msgstr "Um hidróstato muscular que foi colocado perto de um higroscópio."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13"
msgid "What a positively, delightfully odd little lady."
msgstr "Que mocinha positiva e encantadoramente estranha."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14"
msgid "I think it's quite lovely, despite the cracks left by age..."
msgstr "Acho que é bem encantadora, apesar das rachaduras causadas pela idade..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15"
msgid "In medieval chess, this piece was called the elephant."
msgstr "No xadrez medieval, essa peça era chamada de elefante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16"
msgid "The groove in this piece symbolizes the bishop's ceremonial headwear."
msgstr "A ranhura nessa peça simboliza o chapéu cerimonial do bispo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17"
msgid "This would be a practical eating utensil if it weren't bent."
msgstr "Esse seria um utensílio prático para comer se não estivesse torto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18"
msgid "Beware of Greeks bearing gifts."
msgstr "Cuidado com os gregos que trazem presentes."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19"
msgid "A good illustration of gyroscopic precession."
msgstr "Uma ótima ilustração da precessão giroscópica."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2"
msgid "A fake membranophone."
msgstr "Um membranofone falso."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20"
msgid "An instrument of self-sufficiency."
msgstr "Um instrumento de autossuficiência."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21"
msgid "I have an excellent meringue recipe."
msgstr "Tenho uma receita de merengue excelente."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22"
msgid "My grandmother used to knit."
msgstr "Minha avó usava para costurar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23"
msgid "It reminds me of home."
msgstr "Me faz lembrar de casa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24"
msgid "What a positively adorable kitty cat. Sigh."
msgstr "Que gatinho mais adorável. Pff."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25"
msgid "What an unpleasant scent."
msgstr "Que odor desagradável."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26"
msgid "It appears to be a primitive cup fashioned from a tuber."
msgstr "Parece ser um copo primitivo feito de um tubérculo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27"
msgid "I miss the comforts of home."
msgstr "Sinto falta do conforto de casa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28"
msgid "It was once called the \"tower\", long ago."
msgstr "Uma vez foi chamada de \"torre\", muito tempo atrás."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29"
msgid "Calling it a \"castle\" is plainly incorrect."
msgstr "Chamar isso de \"castelo\" é claramente incorreto."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3"
msgid "Oh, I just love the bard."
msgstr "Oh, eu adoro o bardo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30"
msgid "Knights are better pieces when they're active in the center."
msgstr "Os cavalos são peças melhores quando estão ativos no centro."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31"
msgid "In German it is referred to as the \"springer\"."
msgstr "Em alemão se diz \"springer\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32"
msgid "Oh, I got my hopes up for a nice crystal ball."
msgstr "Oh, nutri minhas esperanças por uma bela bola de cristal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33"
msgid "A decorative arachnid adornment! How darling!"
msgstr "Um adorno aracnídeo decorativo! Que lindo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34"
msgid "The paw grants three wishes, with terribly ironic results. So the story goes."
msgstr "O pé concede três desejos, com resultados terrivelmente irônicos. É o que conta a história."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35"
msgid "Odorless. I believe it may have been sugar water."
msgstr "Inodoro. Acredito que possa ter sido água com açúcar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36"
msgid "Dunk those in boiling water before wearing them, dear."
msgstr "Mergulhe-os em água fervente antes de usá-los, meu bem."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37"
msgid "Luckily it is much too brittle to inflict any real damage."
msgstr "Felizmente é frágil demais para infligir qualquer dano real."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38"
msgid "This simply does not work right."
msgstr "Isso simplesmente não funciona direito."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39"
msgid "It appears to be an abandoned glove."
msgstr "Parece ser uma luva abandonada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4"
msgid "What a positively, delightfully odd little fellow."
msgstr "Que bichinho positiva e deliciosamente estranho."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40"
msgid "What a cute little mollusk shaped scale!"
msgstr "Que balança em forma de molusco bem lindinha!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41"
msgid "This does not seem like it came from this world."
msgstr "Não parece que isso tenha visto deste mundo."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42"
msgid "Goodness, it seems quite wistful."
msgstr "Nossa, parece bem nostálgico."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43"
msgid "Perhaps I ought to save it for Webber."
msgstr "Talvez eu guarde para o Webber."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44"
msgid "A waste of a unique flora specimen."
msgstr "Que desperdício de um espécime único de flora."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45"
msgid "What a curious device!"
msgstr "Que dispositivo curioso!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46"
msgid "What an odd contraption."
msgstr "Que geringonça estranha."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5"
msgid "This spacecraft looks to have inadequate thermal controls."
msgstr "Esta espaçonave parece ter controles térmicos inadequados."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6"
msgid "I do hope WX-78 is feeling alright."
msgstr "Espero sinceramente que WX-78 esteja se sentindo bem."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7"
msgid "I think I'll keep this. I know someone who might like it."
msgstr "Acho que vou guardar isso. Sei de alguém que vai gostar."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8"
msgid "It reminds me of my bathtub. I could use a long soak."
msgstr "Me faz lembrar da minha banheira. Adoraria um banho relaxante."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9"
msgid "What a coincidence. My cardigan is missing a button!"
msgstr "Que coincidência. Está faltando um botão no meu cardigã!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER"
msgid "Durable outerwear."
msgstr "Traje externo durável."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER"
msgid "Ample protection against the elements."
msgstr "Ampla proteção contra os elementos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED"
msgid "Unpalatable, but high in protein."
msgstr "Impalatável, mas com alto índice de proteína."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER"
msgid "A utilitarian proboscis."
msgstr "Um probóscide utilitário."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER"
msgid "A specimen of leather and fur."
msgstr "Um espécime de couro e pele."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED"
msgid "A dried collection of plant matter."
msgstr "Uma coleção seca de matéria vegetal."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS"
msgid "The ground. You step on it."
msgstr "O solo. Você pisa nele."

