msgstr "É meio planta demais."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING"
