#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON"
